Upstream states that Key A and Key B are experiment-only keys, intentionally
public for reproduction, and must not be reused for deployment.

The sidecar also downloads, at run time and at the user's request, the
language model Qwen/Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507 (or whatever --model names). No
model weights are distributed with this repository; the model's license is the
user's concern at download time and is stated on its model card.
